# Build 97d: a one-shot case past the last ($11 and up) at a level load.
# loc_8094 clears the whole event word -- the one-shot byte and the camera
# byte -- and nothing else: the level runs as if no case had been asked
# for. Nothing in the ROM writes a high byte past $10 (every write to the
# word was read); the probe puts $11 there before a warp onto Noah F1.
# Before 97d the port's load reported "one-shot event $11 is not ported".
start level $64 33 10
party 4 50
wait idle
oneshot $11
warp $64 33 10
wait level $64
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
press c                      # the word is clear: the C menu opens
wait idle
expect menu $01
shot 01_menu
press b
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
expect level $64 33 9
